  kicker: ["SGLANG-OMNI · SUPPORTED MODELS · ARCHITECTURE COMPARISON", "SGLANG-OMNI · 支持模型 · 架构对比"],
  title: ["Omni Model Architectures: One Framework, Two Families", "Omni 模型架构：一个框架，两大流派"],
  subtitle: ["Every omni model does one thing — hear speech in, speak speech out — through up to four stages: Audio Encoding → Understanding (Thinker) → Speech Synthesis (Talker) → Audio Decoding (Vocoder). These figures are organized to show the shared pattern first and the differences second: gray is the common recipe, color is the architectural decision being compared, chips are spec details. Numeric facts live in the summary table at the end.",
             "每个 omni 模型做的事都是“听懂语音、说出语音”，最多经过四个阶段：音频编码 → 理解（Thinker）→ 语音合成（Talker）→ 音频解码（Vocoder）。这组图的组织原则是“先看共性、再看差异”：灰色是共享配方，彩色是被比较的架构决策，小徽章是规格参数。数字细节集中在文末总结表。"],
  sec0_h: ["The Common Framework: Four Stages", "共同框架：四个阶段"],
  sec0_lead: ["Every model below is a specialization or truncation of this pipeline. Encoding and Decoding are stable across models; the divergence lives in the middle two stages.",
