              "<b>三个分歧轴</b>，全部位于中间两步：<br><br><b>① Thinker–Talker 耦合</b>——嵌套单循环 vs 异步双循环流水线；跨边界传「文本 token + hidden states」（文本作显式语义锚点）还是仅 hidden states。S2-Pro 这类纯 TTS 干脆没有文本桥梁——主干直接自回归生成 semantic codec token。<br><br><b>② codebook 层间依赖</b>——delay pattern（并行头）、嵌套 Dual-AR、主干 + MTP、或 ODE 去噪。<br><br><b>③ 表示</b>——离散 codec token vs 连续 VAE latent。输入侧刻意避开量化；输出侧拥抱量化（连续派除外）。"],
  sec1_h: ["Every Talker Is One of Two Families", "所有 Talker 都属两大流派之一"],
  sec1_lead: ["Strip away the details and every speech generator reduces to one of two computations: autoregressive prediction of discrete codec IDs, or iterative generation of continuous acoustic latents.",
              "剥掉细节，每个语音生成器都可归约为两种计算之一：自回归预测离散 codec ID，或迭代生成连续声学 latent。"],
  sec1_take: ["<b>Takeaway</b> — the discrete family turns speech into a language-modeling problem (and inherits the LLM serving stack); the continuous family trades that away for acoustic headroom. Voxtral sits between them: AR for semantics, flow for acoustics.",
              "<b>要点</b>——离散派把语音变成语言建模问题（从而继承 LLM 推理技术栈）；连续派放弃这一点换取声学上限。Voxtral 居中：语义走 AR、声学走 flow。"],
  sec2_h: ["The Discrete Family: One Recipe, Several Implementations", "离散派：一个配方，多种实现"],
  sec2_lead: ["Within the discrete family, the computation is identical; what changes is the backbone, the codebook count, and how residual layers are completed.",
              "离散派内部，计算是相同的；变化的是 backbone、码本层数、以及残差层的补全方式。"],
  sec3_h: ["The Continuous Family: Latent Generation Instead of Codebook Prediction", "连续派：用 latent 生成取代码本预测"],
  sec3_lead: ["dots.tts and Ming-omni-TTS make the same architectural jump: no discrete tokens anywhere — reference audio and output both live in a VAE latent space.",
              "dots.tts 与 Ming-omni-TTS 做了同一个架构跳跃：全链路无离散 token——参考音频与输出都活在 VAE latent 空间。"],
  sec3_take: ["<b>Takeaway</b> — same skeleton as the discrete family (conditioning → backbone → per-frame generation → decoder), but the frame is a latent vector produced by flow-matching, not a set of categorical IDs. The cost: iterative ODE steps on the latency path.",
              "<b>要点</b>——骨架与离散派相同（条件 → backbone → 逐帧生成 → 解码器），但一帧是 flow-matching 产出的 latent 向量，而不是一组离散 ID。代价：延迟路径上的迭代 ODE 步。"],
