  sec5_take: ["<b>Takeaway</b> — encoder → projector → LLM is the settled recipe; the only real decision is attention structure: dynamic window (AuT), streaming-friendly FSMN memory (SANM), or non-streamable full attention (Whisper). Fun-ASR adds a CTC sidecar whose first-pass hypothesis feeds timestamps and hotword hints.",
              "<b>要点</b>——encoder → projector → LLM 已是定式；唯一真正的决策是注意力结构：动态窗口（AuT）、流式友好的 FSMN 记忆（SANM）、还是不可流式的全注意力（Whisper）。Fun-ASR 额外挂了一个 CTC 旁路，用初识别假设产出时间戳和热词提示。"],
  sec6_h: ["All Models Projected onto the Framework", "所有模型投影到框架上"],
