  sec6_note: ["<b>Reading the map:</b> the discrete camp clusters left (delay pattern → Dual-AR → MTP, in increasing serialization); the continuous camp clusters right (ODE denoising). Voxtral sits in between.<br><br><b>For a serving engine</b> (sglang-omni), x-position predicts scheduling shape: left = one AR loop with wider heads; middle = nested loops needing static KV for the inner loop; right = fixed-step iterative compute that fits CUDA graphs naturally.",
              "<b>怎么读：</b>离散派聚在左侧（delay pattern → Dual-AR → MTP，串行度递增）；连续派聚在右侧（ODE 去噪）。Voxtral 居中。<br><br><b>对推理引擎</b>（sglang-omni）而言，横坐标决定调度形态：左侧＝单 AR 循环加宽头；中间＝嵌套循环，内层需要静态 KV；右侧＝固定步数迭代计算，天然适合 CUDA Graph。"],
